      "updated": 1788454138858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Retrofit 2026-09-03, after PR #3: the seam is the PlotSpec; only *who fills it* varies. All three fillers built and measured.\nFinding: the contract survived two languages, two SDKs and a human filler unchanged; the SDK defaults did not (chatlas strict vs AI SDK non-strict).\nSee docs/design/dynamic-dashboard.md — 'What the three stacks measured'.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Retrofit 2026-09-03, after PR #3: the seam is the PlotSpec; only *who fills it* varies. All three fillers built and measured.\nFinding: the contract survived two languages, two SDKs and a human filler unchanged; the SDK defaults did not (chatlas strict vs AI SDK non-strict).\nSee docs/design/dynamic-dashboard.md — 'What the three stacks measured'.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
